/**
 * dedup() SystemDS Project
 * 
 * Purpose: Identify and remove duplicate rows in a matrix using blocking and similarity.
 *
 * Workflow:
 * MatrixBlock dataset
 *   -> LSHBlocker.block() or KMeansBlocker.cluster()
 *   -> DuplicateDetector.detect()
 *   -> MatrixUtils.removeRows() or extractRows()
 *   -> BuiltinDedupFunction.processInstruction()
 *
 *How they connect?
 *
    * Input matrix
    *  ↓
    * BuiltinDedup.processInstruction()   ← orchestrates the workflow
    *   ↓
    * LSHBlocker.block() or KMeansBlocker.cluster() ← divide into blocks
    *   ↓
    * DuplicateDetector.detect()                  ← find similar row pairs
    *   ↓
    * MatrixUtils.removeRows() or extractRows()   ← remove or extract rows
    *   ↓
    * Output matrix (with or without duplicates)
    *
 *
 *
 */
